<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2100] Queries do not work with binary marshaller and Externalizable objects</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2100</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If new binary marshaller is used and model classes implement &lt;tt&gt;Externalizable&lt;/tt&gt; (which is often the case when user migrates from 1.4 to 1.5), queries stop working and return nulls instead of all field values.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At least, we need to properly document it and throw an exception so that user is aware about the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12919980">IGNITE-2100</key>
